<i>
<p></p><b>Question 25</b>
 asks about the level 
     of standards at your bank between 2005 and the present.  In several quarters during 
     this period, large fractions of respondents to this survey reported having tightened 
     their lending standards on most major loan categories.  For each of the loan categories 
     listed below, please consider the points at which standards at your bank were tightest 
      and easiest 
      during this period.  
        </i>
